      "status": "fixed",
      "status_notes": "CVE-2026-33747 (GHSA-4c29-8rgm-jvjj, GO-2026-4858): before 0.28.1, a custom BuildKit frontend can craft an API message that makes github.com/moby/buildkit write files outside the BuildKit state directory. It is fixed in 0.28.1: https://github.com/moby/buildkit/security/advisories/GHSA-4c29-8rgm-jvjj, https://github.com/moby/buildkit/releases/tag/v0.28.1. Read the Go build information of every Go program in every published build-fips package for Alpine 3.23 (2.6.4-r0 to 2.28.0-r5, 86 versions, x86_64 and aarch64, from the DHI FIPS package repository); its Go programs are /usr/bin/build in every build, /opt/docker/dhi/yq from 2.26.2-r1 and /usr/bin/dhi-source from 2.28.0-r1. Every build before 2.9.2-r0 contains github.com/moby/buildkit 0.26.3, inside the affected range; 2.9.2-r0 and every later build contain 0.28.1 to 0.33.0, which carry the fix. /opt/docker/dhi/yq does not contain the module."
